Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 22:20:29 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(python): follow nextCursor when listing tools,
 resources, and prompts

List calls stopped after the first page, so later tools, resources, and
prompts never reached the session or the agent. Follow nextCursor until
it is exhausted, including an empty-string cursor, and stop when a cursor
repeats.

Co-Authored-By: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
